  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_5713.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El local Pa Kopes, en la avenida Mont&iacute;, 20 de Tales, ha acogido la tarde de este s&aacute;bado un extraordinario concierto de&nbsp;The Autan Plus Band, grupo punk-rock de Onda, que ha imprimido a versiones de varios temas su inconfundible garra.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbandpakopes/img_5703.jpg\" alt=\"img_5703\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbandpakopes/img_5705.jpg\" alt=\"img_5705\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbandpakopes/img_5706.jpg\" alt=\"img_5706\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbandpakopes/img_5708.jpg\" alt=\"img_5708\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbandpakopes/img_5710.jpg\" alt=\"img_5710\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbandpakopes/img_5711.jpg\" alt=\"img_5711\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbandpakopes/img_5713.jpg\" alt=\"img_5713\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbandpakopes/img_5714.jpg\" alt=\"img_5714\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbandpakopes/img_5716.jpg\" alt=\"img_5716\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /